    <category>
        <pattern>HOW DO I USE THIS TOOL</pattern>
        <template><![CDATA[Five steps from the UI:

1. Click Upload File and pick a Tamarin .spthy theory.
2. Tick the mutations you want — start with Skip if you are just exploring.
3. (Forget only) pick a derivation mode: Limited, Specified Depth, or Infinite.
4. Hit Start Mutation. The tool generates the mutants and runs Tamarin on each.
5. When the success dialog appears, review the result bundle. For Forget you also get a derivation tree you can copy or save as .txt.

[[FOLLOWUPS]] What mutations are available? | What should I run first? | How do I read the results?]]></template>
    </category>

    <category><pattern>HOW DO I RUN THE TOOL</pattern><template><srai>HOW DO I USE THIS TOOL</srai></template></category>
